  + keys --------------------------------------------------------------------+
  | Everywhere                                                               |
  |   ?                       every key, by where it works                   |
  |   Tab                     the next tab                                   |
  |   Shift+Tab               the previous tab                               |
  |   F1, Alt+1               Session, where the terminal delivers the key   |
  |   F2, Alt+2               APIs, where the terminal delivers the key      |
  |   F3, Alt+3               Log, where the terminal delivers the key       |
  |   F4, Alt+4               History, where the terminal delivers the key   |
  |   /                       a command, on the Session tab                  |
  |   Ctrl+O                  the whole envelope of the latest call          |
  |   Ctrl+R                  restart SOLAR, and pick up a new build         |
  |   Ctrl+L                  draw the whole screen again                    |
  |   Ctrl+C                  cancel the call in flight when SOLAR offers    |
